# Fitness agent workflow

Follow `AGENTS.md`. Core flow: `/grill-me` → `/to-spec` (one ticket) → optional `/to-tickets` (chunk only if it will not fit one implement chat) → `/implement`. Use `/grill-with-docs` when the session should also write `CONTEXT.md` and ADRs.

Read `docs/agents/issue-tracker.md` before creating issues. Publish to Linear and `.scratch/`. If Linear MCP needs auth, authenticate or continue on the local mirror.

Do not invent stack, persistence, or public contracts. If the grill settled them, they belong on the ticket. If not, stop and ask; do not invent them in `/to-spec` or `/implement`.

Do not use `~/.agents` product-manager / product-requirements / technical-requirements or root `plan.md` in this repo.
